codex
The revised adversary panel now forces every heuristic candidate to satisfy the same endpoint, coefficient-sum, shape, and bound constraints as a serious solver’s candidate. The full 200,000-sample self-test is running; this version is slower because its “random guess” measurement is no longer sampling easy-to-reject noise.
