One more audit finding concerns escalation: the draft multiplied only the ribbon length, which raises the dense mechanical cost but barely affects a solver who already found the sparse route. I’m changing escalation to increase interleaving and coefficient range while keeping the 48-term answer fixed, so it genuinely grows the haystack without consuming the answer-atom budget.
